# Project virtual environment

Use the interpreter and console scripts inside this repo’s `.venv` for every shell command (pytest, pip, pip install, hatch, ruff, etc.).

- **Windows**: `.venv\Scripts\python.exe` and sibling scripts under `.venv\Scripts\` (e.g. `.venv\Scripts\pytest.exe`).
- **macOS / Linux**: `.venv/bin/python` and `.venv/bin/pytest`, etc.

Do not rely on a global `python` or `pytest` on `PATH` unless the virtual environment has been activated and you have confirmed it resolves to `.venv`.
